            {
                "entry_id": "933e93b5-7dc4-3000-bed4-fef067d2f036",
                "word": "видно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                        "entry_id": "933e93b5-7dc4-3000-bed4-fef067d2f036",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вводн. сл. разг. по-видимому, вероятно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bec2f7e-e61a-4fc4-bafc-68f4ce921844",
                                "sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                                "text": "Барыня, видно, со скуки не прочь была даже пококетничать с учителем."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34642f7e-eb12-4048-a629-18c1d6af78d5",
                                "sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                                "text": "― Да, уж с табачком, видно, проститься придётся!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e03b7fdd-ae56-4f24-b41f-a0d428ae3ddd",
                                "sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                                "text": "― Здо́рово не любит он меня, видно ― встал я ему поперёк сердца!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "972290d0-7970-47f1-9253-e74cc68fe5b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "933e93b5-7dc4-3000-bed4-fef067d2f036",
                        "source_sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "evidently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "evidently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bed29c5-6338-34e7-ae4a-afd6ec1a0a6c",
                                        "entry_id": "3992c3e3-6b33-389b-ba97-7d58ef630b6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner which makes the fact or conclusion evident; obviously; as may be clearly inferred."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10184a16-d70e-4f6e-9f9f-a59c4b1f1f1b",
                                                "sense_id": "6bed29c5-6338-34e7-ae4a-afd6ec1a0a6c",
                                                "text": "The half-dozen pieces […] were painted white and carved with festoons of flowers, birds and cupids. To display them the walls had been tinted a vivid blue which had now faded, but the carpet, which had evidently been stored and recently relaid, retained its original turquoise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55209347-7b03-35fc-a1f4-cdde84e4547f",
                                        "entry_id": "3992c3e3-6b33-389b-ba97-7d58ef630b6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In such a way as to be clearly visible or manifest; distinctly, clearly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5625e3b8-cd9f-4545-9d18-54d74b31275e",
                                                "sense_id": "55209347-7b03-35fc-a1f4-cdde84e4547f",
                                                "text": "The ſame mã ſawe in a vyſion evydently aboute the nynthe houre of the daye the angell of god commynge in vnto hym […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc0307e8-f0c4-3019-91a2-b225838245b0",
                                        "entry_id": "3992c3e3-6b33-389b-ba97-7d58ef630b6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "apparently"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "592a2cda-824d-4fe8-baad-923dbb85985a",
                        "source_entry_id": "933e93b5-7dc4-3000-bed4-fef067d2f036",
                        "source_sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "obviously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obviously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                        "entry_id": "08cb5ae5-c6b0-3e0d-a5cc-e246bcc8c28d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an obvious or clearly apparent manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85a2cb00-0ff5-4d12-a65f-dfcc4ec7ebec",
                                                "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                                "text": "She was in floods of tears and obviously very upset."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61370174-7462-4f05-97a9-743a3abcb477",
                                                "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                                "text": "She'd obviously not gone to sleep yet: her eyes were bloodshot with sleepiness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1039c7ad-6815-4a9f-b377-98f227539248",
                                                "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                                "text": "The plane has obviously been delayed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dfc1c3f-39e0-4137-b412-af9e1da3a71b",
                                                "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                                "text": "It was a casual sneer, obviously one of a long line. There was hatred behind it, but of a quiet, chronic type, nothing new or unduly virulent, and he was taken aback by the flicker of amazed incredulity that passed over the younger man's ravaged face."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27eba153-6a8e-4637-94ee-071ae04d77b6",
                                                "sense_id": "96c80741-c542-35b5-8e96-21aed645f096",
                                                "text": "“Temu is gone! What I saw today completely convinced me!” the user wrote. “Local sellers, despite obviously buying some items in advance in a bulk, don’t have all these items I was interested in.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd09882b-dad8-3cf7-9437-ea0b96bf7ba5",
                                        "entry_id": "08cb5ae5-c6b0-3e0d-a5cc-e246bcc8c28d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used as a filler word, or to introduce information even when not obvious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38742759-5d9a-4fa9-825e-818d1b5c53f0",
                                                "sense_id": "cd09882b-dad8-3cf7-9437-ea0b96bf7ba5",
                                                "text": "You weren't to know, but I've spoken to, obviously, Jim about this, and ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a5b3b0a-ca67-4414-ad78-3aab3c1226ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "933e93b5-7dc4-3000-bed4-fef067d2f036",
                        "source_sense_id": "12e6c1fc-a2f3-334d-9c4d-84b13e4bd6d5",
                        "target_lang_word": "apparently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apparently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plainly; clearly; manifestly; evidently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "845e893b-9f78-4967-96af-b5e2e7c19f22",
                                                "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                                "text": "If he should scorn me so apparently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02e20786-fa66-44bf-ac80-8e74a76db730",
                                                "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                                "text": "One, my lord, that doth so palpably, so apparently make her adulteries a trophy, whiles the poting-stick to her unsatiate goatish abomination jeers at, and flouts your sleepish, and more than sleepish, security."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seemingly; in appearance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17632980-be42-46b4-a213-808792486d5e",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                                "text": "A man may be apparently friendly, yet malicious in heart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ac21fa0-00c6-459f-a706-b6d1902c7958",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                                "text": "The r-stems had apparently been reduced to the five nuclear kinship terms that still survive in Modern English."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to what the speaker has read or heard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdde7d89-130b-463c-8181-2f82c36e5898",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "Apparently you are quite a good dancer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "936d47ec-319e-46af-a3a2-d672a2c9010e",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "\"[…] Apparently they are going to contact the adoption agency and see if they can locate that child. […]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5ddb8ab-e3de-4f76-83d1-45bc078298d8",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "Similarly, the new move to apparently involve the National Guard in ICE operations could rub people the wrong way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d7256d8-ee5b-3dd6-ab02-b8577ada3865",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to what one can deduce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "sarcastic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a634ca1-de4b-4b9d-a5c8-24f6cbfd5965",
                                                "sense_id": "7d7256d8-ee5b-3dd6-ab02-b8577ada3865",
                                                "text": "Peridot: I can tell you with certainty that there are things on this planet worth protecting!\nYellow Diamond: What do you know about the Earth?!\nPeridot: Apparently more than you, you clod!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
